      "id": "environment.explosion-source-and-blocks",
      "domain": "environment-hazards",
      "subject": "explosion event",
      "statement": "Explosion events expose the dimension, optional source entity, and impacted blocks, so explosion damage and world mutation can be attributed separately from generic combat damage.",
